From 884061b38a99d04f6a2a8a10106ace9259c04e9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kirill Mitrofanov <kmitrqq@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:33:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 61/64] ASoC: qcom: audioreach: send topology module config to
 any module

The topology can carry a raw APM_CMD_SET_CFG payload per module
(SND_SOC_AR_TPLG_MODULE_CFG_TYPE), but it is only sent for SMECNS_V2.
Send it for every module that has one, after the driver's own setup,
so modules such as speaker protection get their platform calibration.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/audioreach.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/audioreach.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/audioreach.c
index cce0ad3..4bc04c2 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/audioreach.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/audioreach.c
@@ -1536,6 +1536,13 @@ int audioreach_set_media_format(struct q6apm_graph *graph,
 		rc = 0;
 	}
 
+	/*
+	 * Module tuning from the topology (e.g. speaker protection calibration):
+	 * sent after the driver's own setup so it can override the defaults.
+	 */
+	if (!rc && module->data && module->module_id != MODULE_ID_SMECNS_V2)
+		rc = audioreach_set_module_config(graph, module, cfg);
+
 	return rc;
 }
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(audioreach_set_media_format);
